    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061121.0175\n\nAMMAN, Nov. 21 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nJordan's stock market index closes up\n\n\n\n\nThe price index of Jordan's Amman stock market closed at 5,691 points on Tuesday, up 63 points from Monday's finish.\n\nThe turnover was 27.4 million Jordanian dinars (about 38.7 million U.S. dollars). A total of 10.3 million shares were traded in 11,187 deals.",
